        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Abraham: Isaac and Ishmael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are their genealogies: the first-born of Ishmael, Nebaioth; and Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah. These are the sons of Ishmael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Keturah, Abraham's concubine: she bore Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, and Shuah. The sons of Jokshan: Sheba and Dedan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Midian: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All these were the descendants of Keturah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham was the father of Isaac. The sons of Isaac: Esau and Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Esau: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Lotan: Hori and Homam; and Lotan's sister was Timna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Shobal: Alian, Manahath, Ebal, Shephi, and Onam. The sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Anah: Dishon. The sons of Dishon: Hamran, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Ezer: Bilhan, Zaavan, and Jaakan. The sons of Dishan: Uz and Aran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the kings who reigned in the land of Edom before any king reigned over the Israelites: Bela the son of Beor, the name of whose city was Dinhabah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Bela died, Jobab the son of Zerah of Bozrah reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jobab died, Husham of the land of the Temanites reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Husham died, Hadad the son of Bedad, who defeated Midian in the country of Moab, reigned in his stead; and the name of his city was Avith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Hadad died, Samlah of Masrekah reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Samlah died, Shaul of Rehoboth on the Euphrates reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Shaul died, Baal-hanan, the son of Achbor, reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Baal-hanan died, Hadad reigned in his stead; and the name of his city was Pai, and his wife's name Mehetabel the daughter of Matred, the daughter of Mezahab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Hadad died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The chiefs of Edom were: chiefs Timna, Aliah, Jetheth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magdiel, and Iram; these are the chiefs of Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
